      "text": "\"Easter: The Lord is Risen\" by African American artist & illustrator Allan Rohan Crite, who suffused his work with deep religious feeling and is now featured in an exhibition at Rutgers University's Zimmerli Art Museum, through late July zimmerli.rutgers.edu/art/exhibiti...",
