      "voiceName": "Matt Pearce",
      "platform": "bluesky",
      "text": "The extremely online journalist and content creator doesn\u2019t believe in tech hygiene and yearns for a world where \u201cinbox infinity\u201d is celebrated. www.wired.com/story/user-b...",
